\f0\b Phase 3:
\f1\b0  Custom finite/infinite section-loop engine, persistent profiles, and Next-control priority.\

\f0\b Phase 4:
\f1\b0  Waveform editor, preview, and boundary adjustment.\

\f0\b Phase 5:
\f1\b0  Auto Loop analysis and candidate selection.\

\f0\b Phase 6:
